        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robin White, Kevin Ullyett, Patty Fendick, Jill Hetherington, Gretchen Magers\n- Events: 1989 Great American Bank Classic – Doubles\n- Places: United States, Zimbabwe, Salisbury, Harare\n\nFacts:\n- Robin White was born on December 10, 1963, and she is a former professional tennis player from the United States.\n- Kevin Ullyett was born on May 23, 1972, in Salisbury, now Harare, and he is a former professional tennis player from Zimbabwe.\n- At the 1989 Great American Bank Classic – Doubles, defending champions Patty Fendick and Jill Hetherington lost in the quarterfinals to Gretchen Magers and Robin White.",
